  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Pugilists are brawlers of swagger. While a monk may dedicate themself to a single focused blow, a pugilist will break their fingers and keep punching with the bloody stump.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Pugilists</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Carl, Dungeon Crawler Carl</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Rocky Balboa, Rocky</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Hellboy, Hellboy</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Stiffener Medick, Redwall</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Pugilist</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Pugilists are frontline bruisers. Stay in the frontline, even while at low HP.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack (Brawl)</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Frontline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Brawl, Influence</span></p>",
